comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-26T02:46:34.152Z","harness:claude-code","Codex review round 19 on PR #1782: pm --output-budget -- package list --output-budget unbounded reaches the inventory command in Commander, but isStaticExtensionInventoryInvocation returns false because removeLeadingCommandTerminator skips the first -- as the value of --output-budget while findBootstrapCommandTokenIndex treats it as the terminator; the static route then misses and the pre-action hook can activate extensions. One shared required-value rule for -- in value position should serve both helpers."
